<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\Dark_Energy.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>My mind went blank.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\追加\天秤.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n10000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
For nine years I'd carried the sin of killing―
{PAUSE ""}
scales tipped by a rigged trial of my own making.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was a slave to those scales.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The scales whispered to me on the sly.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, why are </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> carrying me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　But you've come this far―keep carrying me forever, why don't you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like a cuckoo's egg <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="たくらん">left in another bird's nest</STYLE>, the scales just kept brazenly riding on my back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without a shred of shame, it whispered to me, grinning, with its foul breath.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'ve always believed you killed five people, haven't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Did </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> really kill them? Wasn't it a dream?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was a dream...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That can't be...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then is </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">your aunt</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> lying?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Which is the lie―that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> killed them, or </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> story? Which do you think?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE> had no reason to lie.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then had I just been mistaken...?<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\料亭部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Inside my heart, I checked my answers against myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The scales inside me were reading out their own charges.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the charges were―
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7" RUBY="から">empty</STYLE>.<PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\歪むカオ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Uh... this is going back to square one, but are you sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> killed five people...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... Then who else but me could have secretly killed five whole people?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Besides, smashing heads in with a blunt instrument is harder than stabbing with a knife. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Who on earth would kill like that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"You're right... Stabbing a vital spot with a knife is easier, and kills for sure."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, let me meet this </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> girl as soon as you can."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... The thirteenth-year memorial begins in nine days. Before then, I want to gather as much information as I can and sort it out."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"You're right... From here on, it looks like we'll need </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> help."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and I have to be kept from ever meeting face to face. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">If that murderous intent welled up again..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"All right, don't worry about that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">―I'll explain the situation to her and try to arrange a meeting."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How far could this <STYLE ID="8">Goto</STYLE> girl widen my view, with nothing but my vague memories and subjective information?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The battle had already begun.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
